*Description: A television screenshot used for promotional purposes for their original series ''[[Sons of Anarchy]]'' showing [[William Lucking]] as [[Piney Winston]].

== Fair use for [[Marcus Álvarez]] ==
This image, PineyWinston.jpg, is being linked here; though the picture is subject to copyright I ([[User:WölffReik|WölffReik]]) feel it is covered by the U.S. fair use laws because:
# it is a promotional screenshot of a television character;
# it does not limit the copyright owner's rights to sell the DVD of the show in any way;
# copies could not be used to make illegal copies of the program;
# the image is accompanied by a description of the characters role and critical commentary of their importance on the show;
# the image is significant because it identifies a starring character and the subject of the article.

